              "aws_devops.verify_restored_service_and_data_against_rto_rpo_in_an_isolated_rehearsal#tb5"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "IF(test,\"pass\",\"fail\") returns pass when the test is true and fail otherwise; <= means less than or equal to. Compare restoration minutes with H2 and data-gap minutes with K2 separately. For example, =IF(ROUND((D2-C2)*1440,0)<=H2,\"pass\",\"fail\") returns the RTO conclusion.",
          "role": "example",
