        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Put literal text in double quotes and join text, cell values and calculated values with &: =A2&\": RTO=\"&ROUND((D2-C2)*1440,0)&\" minutes \"&IF(ROUND((D2-C2)*1440,0)<=H2,\"pass\",\"fail\"). Extend this row summary with \"; RPO=\" and the separately calculated gap and RPO conclusion. Build the second summary by changing row references from 2 to 3, then join the summaries with &\" | \"&. Keep the measurements calculated from timestamps, not copied from result columns.",
